  intro i
  fin_cases i
  · exact candidate23ClosedTernarySubformsTile0
  · exact candidate23ClosedTernarySubformsTile1
  · exact candidate23ClosedTernarySubformsTile2
  · exact candidate23ClosedTernarySubformsTile3
  · exact candidate23ClosedTernarySubformsTile4
